  "title": "综合整治铺新路 规划引领谋新篇",
  "date": "2022-06-18",
  "url": "https://esb.xbfzb.com/html/2022-06/18/content_18425_6331563.htm",
  "source": "esb.xbfzb.com_西部法制报",
  "category": "其他媒体报道",
