  "title": "如东全域土地综合整治“点土成金”",
  "date": "2024-09-19",
  "url": "https://www.zgjssw.gov.cn/shixianchuanzhen/nantong//202409/t20240919_8396169.shtml",
  "source": "zgjssw.gov.cn_中共江苏省委新闻网",
  "category": "其他媒体报道",
  "levels": [],
  "coverage": "extracted",
