  "title": "全国推广！常州一地入选",
  "date": "2025-07-01",
  "url": "https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20250701A04SV600",
  "source": "news.qq.com_腾讯新闻",
  "category": "其他媒体报道",
  "levels": [],
